<section id="about" class="about" data-reveal>
	<div class="container">
		<h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
		<p class="about__body">
			I'm an engineer who moves easily between hardware and software: wiring
			up sensors and microcontrollers, writing the embedded firmware and
			backend services that talk to them, and getting the networking right in
			between. I've also spent time on the business side — selling websites
			to customers as part of a small team — which shaped how I think about
			building things people actually need. These days I'm working on ERP
			systems, applying the same systems-thinking to business software.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		padding-block: var(--space-6);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
	}

	.about__body {
		max-width: 65ch;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
	}
</style>
